   "user_id": "U0NFGTOBY",
   "text": "Overnight draft of the 17 Nov ratings is in Box (Rating Desk / Overnight). Built on the 00Z MetDesk pull at 05:00 - handover note in Notion has the station figures. Constrained on my draft: BRTN-1, OXFD-2.",
